WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:10.829
The OSINT Search tool queries across one hundred and fifty-one bills, three hundred and forty MPs, lobbying records, and political donation databases — all from public Canadian government data.

00:00:10.829 --> 00:00:20.818
Type a name, a riding, a bill number, or a keyword, and the system returns cross-referenced results linking parliamentary activity to lobbying contacts and campaign finance.

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:25.579
This is the tool that turns a sprawling public record into an answer in under a second.
